  "subject": "a man in Surabaya who signs up at a shophouse gym on the second of January, goes exactly once, and keeps paying the monthly auto-debit all year while the receptionist still waves at him by name",
  "caption": "East Java sound horeg battle-bass DJ, the mid-2020s street sound-system style. Huge distorted sub-bass drops, a pounding four-on-the-floor kick, quick kendang koplo fills between drops, a siren-like square synth lead, crowd whistles. Loud open-air truck sound-system mix with heavy low end and slapback echo. Male MC-style shouted verses with a crowd gang-chant chorus. 132 BPM, A minor. Rowdy, self-mocking, laughing. No autotune, no trap rap, no pop ballad section, no dubstep wobble, no English hook.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - siren synth, bass check, whistle]\n\n[Verse 1]\nTanggal dua Januari\nDaftar gym di ruko Rungkut\nDatang sekali, angkat dua kali\nBesoknya badan remuk semua\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nTiap bulan tanggal lima\nSaldo turun tiga ratus ribu\n\n[Chorus]\nBayar terus, bayar terus\nMember yang nggak pernah datang\nKartu member di dompet lusuh\nOtotnya cuma di niat doang\n\n[Verse 2]\nBulan Mei lewat depan ruko\nMbak resepsionis lambaikan tangan\nDia hafal nama aku\nPadahal ketemu sekali doang\n\n[Bridge - kendang koplo break]\nYang angkat beban orang lain\nYang angkat tagihan aku\n\n[Chorus]\nBayar terus, bayar terus\nDesember aku datang lagi\nMbak-nya bingung, ini siapa\nAku bilang, member setia\n\n[Outro - bass drop, crowd whistles]",
